# Midnight Snack (CR 602.2b, 601.2f): "{2}{B}, Sacrifice this enchantment: ..." needs a black mana. Black Lotus pays for the
# Snack itself; then Bot1 has three mana (Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire) and no black source, so the ability is refused
# for want of the {B}, and the Snack stays on the battlefield with Bot2 at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Midnight Snack
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Midnight Snack.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Midnight Snack.Activate(Bot2; Mana: short)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Midnight Snack; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire
Bot2.Life = 20
